"1213","Abu Hurayra said"
"1214","Al-Bara' ibn 'Azib said"
"1215","Abu Hurayra said"
"1216","Similar to 1211."
"1217","When a man enters his house or goes to bed"
"1218","Al-Bara' said"
"1219","'Abdullah ibn 'Amr reported that the Prophet"
"1220","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"1221","Rabi'a ibn Ka'b related"
"1222","Ibn 'Abbas reported that the Prophet"
"1223","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"1224","Jabir ibn 'Abdullah reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"1225","Ibn 'Abbas said"
"1226","Abu Sa'id said"
"1227","Ibn 'Umar reported that the Prophet"
"1228","'Umar said"
"1229","Ibn 'Umar heard the Prophet"
"1230","Abu Musa said"
"1231","Abu Mulayka related that when it rained"
"1232","Ibn 'Abbas reported that the Prophet"
